{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-13-1","title":"Job 13:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Job reproves his friends for partiality. 14 He professes his confidence in God; and entreats to know his own sins, and God's purpose in afflicting him.</p>\n<p>Lo. 5:9-16; 12:9-25; 42:3-6 ear. 4:12; 5:27; 8:8-10; 15:17,18; Ps 78:3,4; 1Jo 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-2","title":"Job 13:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>12:3; 15:8,9; 34:35; 35:16; 37:2; 40:4,5; 42:7; 1Co 8:1,2 2Co 11:4,5,16-18; 12:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-3","title":"Job 13:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Surely. 22; 9:34,35; 11:5; 23:3-7; 31:35 I desire. 9:3,14,15; Isa 1:18-20; 41:21; Jer 12:1,2; *marg: Mic 6:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-4","title":"Job 13:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>ye are forgers. 4:7-11; 5:1-5; 8:3,4; 18:5-21; 21:27-34; 22:6-30; Ex 20:16 Ps 119:69 physicians. 6:21; 16:2; Jer 6:14; 8:22; 30:13; 46:11; Eze 34:4; Ho 5:13; Mr 2:17 Mr 5:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-5","title":"Job 13:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Oh that ye. 13; 11:3; 16:3; 18:2; 19:2; 21:2,3; 32:1 and it. Pr 17:28; Ec 5:3; Am 5:13; Jas 1:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-6","title":"Job 13:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>21:2,3; 33:1-3; 34:2; Jud 9:7; Pr 8:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-7","title":"Job 13:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>4:7; 11:2-4; 17:5; 32:21,22; 36:4; Joh 16:2; Ro 3:5-8; 2Co 4:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-8","title":"Job 13:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>32:21; 34:19; Ex 23:2,3; Pr 24:23; Mal 2:9; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-9","title":"Job 13:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>search. 34:36; Ps 44:21; 139:23; Jer 17:10 as one. 17:2; Isa 28:22; Ga 6:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-10","title":"Job 13:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>reprove. 42:7,8; Ps 50:21,22; 82:2; Jas 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-11","title":"Job 13:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Shall. Ps 119:120; Jer 5:22; 10:10; Mt 10:28; Re 15:3,4 his dread. 21; Ex 15:16; Isa 8:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-12","title":"Job 13:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>remembrances. 18:17; Ex 17:14; Ps 34:16; 102:12; 109:15; Pr 10:7; Isa 26:14 ashes. Ge 18:27 to bodies. 4:19; Ge 2:7; 2Co 5:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-13","title":"Job 13:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Hold your peace. Heb. Be silent from me. let me. 5; 7:11; 10:1; 21:3 and let come. 6:9,10; 7:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-14","title":"Job 13:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>I take. 18:4; Ec 4:5; Isa 9:20; 49:26 and put. Jud 12:3; 1Sa 19:5; 28:21; Ps 119:109</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-15","title":"Job 13:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>he slay me. 18; 19:25-28; 23:10; Ps 23:4; Pr 14:32; Ro 8:38,39 but I will. 10:7; 16:17,21; 23:4-7; 27:5; 31:31-37; 40:2,4,5,8; 1Jo 3:20 maintain. Heb. prove, or argue.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-16","title":"Job 13:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>my salvation. Ex 15:2; Ps 27:1; 62:6,7; 118:14,21; Isa 12:2; Jer 3:23; Ac 13:47 for an hypocrite. 8:13; 27:8-10; 36:13; Isa 33:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-17","title":"Job 13:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>6; 33:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-18","title":"Job 13:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>I have ordered. 16:21; 23:4; 40:7 I know. 9:2,3,20; 40:7,8; Isa 43:26; Ro 8:33,34; 2Co 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-19","title":"Job 13:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>that will plead. 19:5; 33:5-7,32; Isa 50:7,8; Ro 8:33 if I hold. 13; 7:11; Jer 20:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-20","title":"Job 13:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>do not two. 9:34,35 hide myself. Ge 3:8-10; Ps 139:12; Re 6:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-21","title":"Job 13:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Withdraw. 10:20; 22:15-17 let not. 11; 33:7; Ps 119:120</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-22","title":"Job 13:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>9:32; 38:3; 40:4,5; 42:3-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-23","title":"Job 13:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>many. 22:5; Ps 44:20,21 make me. 36:8,9; Ps 139:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-24","title":"Job 13:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>hidest thou. 10:2; 29:2,3; De 32:20; Ps 10:1; 13:1; 44:24; 77:6-9; 88:14; Isa 8:17 holdest me. 16:9; 19:11; 30:21; 31:35; 33:10; 1Sa 28:16; La 2:5; 2Th 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-25","title":"Job 13:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>break. 14:3; 1Sa 24:14; Isa 17:13; Mt 12:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-26","title":"Job 13:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>writest. 3:20; Ru 1:20; Ps 88:3-18 makest. 20:11; Ps 25:7; Pr 5:11-13; Jer 31:19; Joh 5:5,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-27","title":"Job 13:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>puttest. 33:11; 2Ch 16:10-12; Pr 7:22; Ac 16:24 and lookest. Heb. and observest. 10:6; 14:16; 16:9 settest. 2:7 heels. Heb. roots.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-13-28","title":"Job 13:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>And he. 30:17-19,29,30; Nu 12:12 as a garment. 4:19; Ps 39:11; Ho 5:12</p>"}]}